  "description": "`Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Providers.LibUsbDotNet` is a backend provider for [Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions)\nthat utilizes the [LibUsbDotNet v2](https://github.com/LibUsbDotNet/LibUsbDotNet) library for hardware communication.\nIt enables applications using the `Smdn.IO.UsbHid.*` abstraction layer to operate on HID devices through the `LibUsbDotNet` implementation.",
